00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.089 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Hey. How are you, Seth?

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:25.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Absolutely thrilled
to have you here.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.427 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Aw, thank you so much.

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:29.329 size:78% position:39%
-I know it seems like
a million years ago,

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:32.098
mostly because there was
a full audience in the studio --

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
