after an incredibly long break

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:42.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just wonder,
how quickly did it come back

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:46.312
Did muscle memory kick in fo
what a week at "SNL" was like?

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.414 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, it does.

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:51.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know from doing that show.
It's such a grind.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:54.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
Once you leave there,
I found that, 36 years later

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:57.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
