you fall right back into it.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:58.625 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was surreal.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.360 size:84% position:42%
It was like going back
to the old high school.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.263
-You know, this film, one of the
most wonderful things about it

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
