for me to see the new characters

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:11.404 line:92%
you welcomed into the film

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.673 size:78% position:39%
I'm very good friends
with Leslie Jones.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:17.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Leslie Jones.
Leslie Jones in this movie

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:22.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right?
-Leslie Jones. Oh. So funny.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.017 line:92%
-I mean, I said to her, "Look.

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:26.886
It's always great to kill
in a movie, which you did,

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:30.390
but you killed in a movie
alongside Eddie Murphy."

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.493 size:81% position:41%
And that just must be
such a thrill for her.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:36.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
How long have you been aware
of Leslie?

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.864 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-For years.

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:38.898 line:92%
I saw Leslie years ago in, like,

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:44.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
an after-hours comedy club
like, downtown L.A.

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:49.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
