with the older ones,

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.000 size:88% position:44%
with the younger ones,
and being in the middle.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.004
-I recently saw --
It was posted online by Netflix.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:53.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was Arsenio Hall
telling a story

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:55.909
