bringing you up on stage.

00:02:55.909 --> 00:02:58.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
I believe at The Comedy Store.
Was he always nice?

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:01.681
-He was always super-nice to me,
Richard.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:02.815 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Always super-nice.

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:05.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But he brought you on stage
according to this story,

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:09.522
