00:03:12.659 --> 00:03:15.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was thrilling.
I turned it out.

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like --
He was sitting there.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:18.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like --
I wanted to show off.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:20.233 line:92%
Like, "Watch this!" You know

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:24.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just to make him laugh
